requirements.detail:
Lots are grouped by identical construction and types. Random samples are selected for visual/dimensional and performance testing:
- Up to 50 rolls: Sample size = 3, Permissible defective rolls = 0;
- 51 to 150 rolls: Sample size = 5, Permissible defective rolls = 0;
- 151 to 300 rolls: Sample size = 8, Permissible defective rolls = 1 (Acceptance No. = 1, Rejection No. = 3);
- 301 to 500 rolls: Sample size = 13, Permissible defective rolls = 2;
- 501 rolls and above: Sample size = 20, Permissible defective rolls = 3.
